<title>BRAZIL: Brazil aluminium output marginally up in June.</title>
<headline>Brazil aluminium output marginally up in June.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian production of primary aluminium totalled 98,300 tonnes in June, 0.1 percent up on the 98,200 tonnes produced in June 1996, the Brazilian Aluminium Association (ABAL) said in a statement.</p>
<p>Production in the first half of this year is marginally down on last year however, reaching 590,800 tonnes, down 0.6 percent on the 594,300 tonnes produced in January/June 1996.</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
